; DNS-AID for danmull.in
; draft-mozleywilliams-dnsop-dnsaid + RFC 9460 HTTPS/SVCB
;
; These records live in Cloudflare DNS, not in Pages. Publish with
; scripts/publish-dns-aid.sh or add them in the dashboard (see README).
; Do not advertise _a2a — this origin has no A2A agent.

_index._agents.danmull.in.  3600 IN HTTPS 1 danmull.in. alpn="h2" port=443
_mcp._agents.danmull.in.    3600 IN HTTPS 1 danmull.in. alpn="h2" port=443
